# Production: the deployed WebSocket server URL, baked into the build (public, not a secret).
# MUST be wss:// (the https game page cannot open a plaintext ws:// — mixed content is blocked).
# Update this to your actual Fly app hostname, then rebuild (`npm run build`). If you deploy
# with the default app name in fly.toml, this value is already correct.
VITE_WS_URL=wss://sidewalks-of-rage-ws.fly.dev
